※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4635

※ `→ str in ⎕static` says the answer is in the image, made while compiling.
※ Nothing can be copied into the image while the program runs, so an answer
※ made anywhere else is refused rather than copied.

fn joined(a: str) → str in ⎕static:
    a ⧺ "!"

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
